WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.400
This is Yousef. He's 7, and he's autistic.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.200
Every morning feels too loud, with too many steps.

3
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.400
His mom helps him through every single one.

4
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.400
So his parents got him Rafeeq.

5
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.600
Rafeeq: Good morning, Yousef. Let's brush your teeth.

6
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.100
But sometimes it all becomes too much.

7
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.700
Rafeeq notices the signs early.

8
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Rafeeq: Breathe with me. In... and out.

9
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.100
Rafeeq: Let's keep going. Just one small step.

10
00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:49.500
Rafeeq: Well done! Good job, bravo Yousef!

11
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.300
Later that morning, Mom didn't have to step in.

12
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Rafeeq. Less help every week. That's the point.

